WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:04.897
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.898 --> 00:00:07.816
What do they see?

3
00:00:07.817 --> 00:00:11.463
They see snow.

4
00:00:11.464 --> 00:00:21.169
The blobs run through the snow.

5
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:42.554
The blobs ride a sled.

6
00:00:42.555 --> 00:01:05.499
They make snow angels.

7
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:21.756
They make snowballs.

8
00:01:21.757 --> 00:01:46.601
They make snow forts.

9
00:01:46.602 --> 00:02:11.506
They make a snow blob.

10
00:02:11.507 --> 00:02:16.538
The blobs get some bowls, fruit, and spoons.

11
00:02:16.539 --> 00:02:21.436
What are you making now, blobs?

12
00:02:21.437 --> 00:02:31.491
They make bingsu!

13
00:02:31.492 --> 00:02:35.285
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:35.286 --> 00:02:39.907
Good-bye!

